==Battleground==
*3 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Corporal Weyland]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Cyberhorn]] spawns.
**1 [[Brollow]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**2 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**2 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As long as you have a decent way to deal with Cyberhorn here, the stage poses little additional threat.

